# second pass: title, launch a ball, work the flippers, pause, hotkeys
wait 240
mash START 6 40
mash A 20 40
wait 300
shot title
hold A 40
wait 200
shot launched
press L 6
press R 6
hold L 30
hold R 30
wait 60
shot flippers
press START 4
wait 60
shot pause
press B 4
wait 30
press HOME+UP 6
wait 20
shot swapped
press HOME+UP 6
wait 20
shot back
press HOME+R 6
wait 60
press HOME+L 6
wait 10
shot loaded
